{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "story_wulfen_set_1", "eventName": "最後一次探險", "entryType": "NONE", "storyCode": null, "avgTag": "幕間", "storyName": "最後一次探險", "storyInfo": "穆麗兒承接了一項她熟識的網友發布的委託，而在實際見面後，穆麗兒發覺對方的目的其實並不在於“探險”。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$calm_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_forest", "screenadapt": "showall"}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 4.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$leaveshake", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1", "focus": "m", "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說真的，你在群組裡收回的那條訊息，還算數吧？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1"}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算我收回了，你現在不還是接了這個“委託”嘛。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因為當時你寫了“最後一次探險”，我……", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒有意識地頓了頓，觀察著面前人的表情，見對方表情並無異樣，才繼續說下去。"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我還以為你對地質勘探失去興趣了呢。那怎麼可以，我當初可是看著你的影片成長起來的，你要退坑，我第一個不同意好吧！", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#3$1"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說得我好像是什麼大前輩一樣，你實地考察過的地方可比我多得多。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒想到說著說著，結果就變成網友見面了啊。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 27, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我倒是沒怎麼構想過網友見面這種事……BM，你還是我第一個實際見到面的網友呢！", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#12$1"}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過……", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我設想中的見面可不是這樣的場景啊——", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陽光從樹冠縫隙間灑下，帶著潮濕的水氣，晃動著落在她們腳邊的石頭堆上。"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒對著地圖和終端中的資料看了半天，原地轉了兩圈，最後把目光定格在一團綠茫茫的密林上。"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_caveentrance2_d", "screenadapt": "showall"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你確定不是這裡嗎？", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒已經來到一塊被風化的頁岩邊觀察岩層紋路，聽到這話，只看了BM一眼，又把注意力轉回石頭上。"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "剛剛那條小徑是廢棄的運輸路線，很多年沒用過了，不在地圖上。我們現在的方向更偏東南一點，應該再往西繞回去。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這裡之前下過雨，也不好走，最好還是小心一點。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你早就知道我們走錯了嗎？", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯哼。我還在想你什麼時候會發現呢。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……好哇，你就是想看我出糗。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "誰叫你昨天偷拍我睡覺！還說什麼“記錄山野生物在自然中的棲息狀態”……", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#4$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我、我都沒拍你自製的奇怪乾糧欸！你不覺得它看起來和我們早上看到的那片岩層剖面很像嗎？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#4$1"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "蛤？哪裡像了？你不要吃就還我，我不跟你交換便當了。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿嘿，我偏不——", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0, "xstrength": 25.0, "ystrength": 25.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rockfall", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "BM剛想回應穆麗兒，卻腳下一滑，她下意識地抓住身邊的一根枯枝，枯枝卻被她從土中扯出，連帶著鬆動的石塊一起滑落下來。"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "泥沙開始迅速崩塌，她整個人都跟著往下滑。"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_punch02", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒瞬間回頭，迅速伸手牢牢抓住BM的手腕，同時尾巴立刻纏住身邊的岩石，穩穩地將自己固定起來。"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抓緊我，背包先丟掉！", "name": "穆麗兒"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我的東西……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別管了！", "name": "穆麗兒"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聽我的，背包可以再想辦法！", "name": "穆麗兒"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "BM咬了咬牙，終於鬆開背包，用力抓緊穆麗兒的手。穆麗兒尾巴用力，將兩人拉回了安全區域。"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_erthshkng", "loop": "false", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.3}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rockfall", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$smallearthquake", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "巨大的滾石和泥塊迅速吞噬了BM的背包，又迅速滾落到坡底的山溝裡，發出一聲悶響。"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "灰塵散去，兩人氣喘吁吁地坐在地上。"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼……呼，人沒事就好，別擔心，物資還能再想辦法，有我在，還能讓你餓肚子嗎？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1"}, {"id": 96, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "幸好重要的勘探儀器不在那個包裡，至於補給，我這裡的還夠撐一陣子。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1"}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……嗯，沒事，只是補給而已。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "BM的臉色一變。她的指尖微微顫抖，視線焦慮地落在坡底那個隱隱約約露出一角的背包上，似乎在擔憂著什麼更重要的東西。"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$drift_intro", "key": "$drift_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（BM看起來不太好，不過山崩這種事，誰遇到了都會害怕吧……）", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（嗯？那是……）", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒順著BM的目光，也注意到了那露出的一角，旁邊散落著一些閃閃發光的金屬管狀物品。"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她心中一凜，幾乎立刻就認出來——那是礦石病抑制劑。"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒迅速轉移了視線，沒有讓自己的表情有任何異樣，只是若無其事地站起身，重新檢查自己背包裡的物品。"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沉默就這樣延續了一小段時間。"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不好意思……我拖累你了。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說什麼呢？探險這種事，物資遺失不算什麼啦。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "走吧，我們先去安全點的地方休息一下，等你情緒穩定一點再說。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "BM垂下眼睛，默默地點了點頭。"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_campsite_d", "screenadapt": "showall"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "第二天一早醒來，穆麗兒發現身邊的位置空了，BM悄無聲息地離開了營地。"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她沒有顯出驚慌，只是安靜地收拾起背包，開始沿著附近的山道緩緩尋找。"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不久，她在一塊遠離營地的大岩石旁發現了BM。BM正坐在石頭上，神情恍惚地望著遠處，似乎已經坐了很久。"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你怎麼了？一聲不吭就跑出來了。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1"}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……欸？！", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還是被你找到了。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不要太小看你追蹤的探險家啊。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 143, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對不起，我不想拖累你了。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 147, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒安靜地看著她，沒有說話。"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "發這個“委託”……不，這原本甚至都算不上是“委託”。我不過是想再出來走走，看看沒看過的地方罷了，沒想過要走完。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因為你回覆了我，所以我才想說……要不然讓你陪我一起出門看看。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我已經很滿足了，能和自己最喜歡的偶像見面，還能一起探險，我這幾天真的很開心。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果不是我不小心搞砸的話。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你應該也看到了吧？我包裡的……呃，藥劑。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒沒說話，也沒否認。"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對不起，我不該瞞著你，更不該害你的物資也損失了。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "算了吧，我本來就是個麻煩，你不用在這裡陪我繼續浪費時間。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵，反正我的人生也沒意義了，總有一天要爆炸的。這裡嘛，畢竟是承載了這麼多美好回憶的地方，要不乾脆死在——", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你在說什麼啊？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#7$1"}, {"id": 173, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒沒再繼續說些什麼，只是從口袋中摸出一管藥劑，塞到BM的手裡，絲毫不管她驚愕的表情。"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "然後轉過身，徑直走到不遠處的山體裂痕邊緣，平靜地取出勘探工具，專注地開始測量和記錄數據。"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你……你怎麼……？", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 179, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們不是來探險的嗎？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1"}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要不要接我的委託——探礦的委託，粉絲小姐？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這條礦脈再往前走，應該能看到比較稀有的伴生礦，但我也沒真的見過那種礦石，也不知道能不能找到呢。你要不要幫我？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 185, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "短暫的沉默後，BM低頭苦笑了一下。她掙扎著站起身，緩緩走到穆麗兒身邊，蹲下身幫她扶穩儀器，手上的動作異常認真。"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_wilderness_n", "screenadapt": "showall"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那天直到下午兩人沒有再說話，只安靜地沿路勘察。地勢下沉，岩層褶皺豐富，每過一段路，兩人就得停下來核對一次地貌記錄。"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "晚一點的時候，山霧開始聚起。她們在一塊風化破損的不是很嚴重的岩棚下紮營。火光不大，兩人的影子在岩壁上被拉得很長。"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說實話，我沒想到，注意到我收回的那條訊息的人，以及最後陪我走這一趟的人會是你。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因為你的風格一直以來都是獨自探險嘛。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那也得看旅伴是誰囉。我畢竟當初是看你的影片……", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "停停停，別幫我這個粉絲貼金了。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雖然看起來好像是誤打誤撞走到現在，但你其實來過這裡吧？", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。幾個月前，我滑到一個舊貼文，裡面有一張模糊的斷層照片。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那張照片我一看就覺得眼熟，好像是我曾經拍過的某個地方。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 213, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你記得自己拍過的所有岩層長什麼樣？", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有些會記得。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1"}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "尤其是那張……那時我還是個剛開始探險的新手，一個人邊走邊哭，想找的礦脈找不到，補給又沒帶夠，差點回不去。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 219, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以要再來一趟？", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 221, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊，我很不甘心呢。之前的那次探險，我什麼都沒能帶走，這次總要見識點什麼再回去。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還好這次你有了“山野生物在自然中的棲息狀態”的照片。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 225, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒笑著揍了BM一拳，同時把手電筒拿給她，指了指前方一處小型的斷裂岩層。"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們明天早上可以從這裡繞上去看看，可能會有些新發現也說不定呢。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#12$1"}, {"id": 231, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "BM接過手電筒，看了眼地圖，又低下頭，把它還了回去。"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "火光微顫，穆麗兒像是下定了什麼決心一樣，突然開口。"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你還記得我發布的一個關於坑洞裡的稀有礦的影片嗎？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 237, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是說我開始追蹤你的那個影片嗎？", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 239, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當時我嚇了一跳呢，影片品質如此之高的網紅竟然早就在追蹤我，不過在那之後，我就成為你的鐵粉啦。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 241, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿嘿……其實，那個影片，我本來沒想拍的。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 243, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "第一次去的時候我完全沒有找到礦，勘探也失敗了，還在山腳下迷路了兩天。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 245, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "回到城市裡之後，我本來已經不打算繼續更新了，還想著把庫存的影片全都上傳了之後，就刪除帳號。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 247, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈啊？！難怪你那個時候瘋狂上傳作品！", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 249, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……但是最後你也沒刪。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 251, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，回家之後，我誤發送了一張模糊的照片到一個群組裡，然後終端就開始震個不停。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 253, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有人問我是不是改行做藝術攝影了，有人在猜這張圖是不是我下一個影片的預告。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1"}, {"id": 255, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有一個人……回覆我說“這片岩層的褶皺結構像是那一帶南端山體的邊界斷層”。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他還貼了對照圖，說我照片拍得太模糊了，下次記得加個偏光鏡再拍。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 259, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不記得自己當時有沒有回覆他了……但是過了兩天，我就按照這個人提的關鍵詞查到了新的礦脈線索。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "後來……後來，我意外地發現了那片稀有礦石，然後就是你們看到的那個影片啦。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 263, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是因為陌生人的一句話……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 265, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，就只是因為陌生人的一句話。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 267, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 269, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒，你……你比我堅強得多。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我……我不知道。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1"}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果沒有那個陌生人那句無心的回覆，也許事情不會有變化。當然了，也許之後也會有其他的變化，但我的故事就是這樣發展下去了。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1"}, {"id": 275, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以當你說，這是“最後一次探險”的時候，我想，我也應該像那個陌生人那樣，對你說些什麼。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1"}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "或者和你一起做些什麼。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在那一瞬間，穆麗兒突然有些恍神。"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她說出口的故事、沒說出口的故事，這些故事的主人公甚至開始不再是自己，而是面前的女孩。"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她看著面前女孩的臉龐，那臉龐上分明掛著自己的模樣。"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在那個夜晚看著終端中陌生人貼出的回覆，久久沉默的穆麗兒，在多年後的群組中，執意要追著一條發出後就迅速收回的訊息。"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "49_g13_smallroom", "screenadapt": "showall"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.8, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$keyboard", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“這是我的最後一次探險”……", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1"}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不行，還是刪掉這句吧……就算是最後一則影片，簡介上也不用寫這麼矯情的話吧……", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#3$1"}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好氣啊，明明是最後一次探險，但我什麼都沒找到。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#7$1"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "人生為什麼總要有這樣的遺憾呢？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#7$1"}, {"id": 304, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那時她剛剛確診礦石病，整晚整晚地睡不著覺。"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "除了害怕，更多的是難以接受自己的身體再也不能無所顧忌地長途穿越無人區……"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "再也不能全然不顧地半夜在岩層縫隙中取樣，再也不能以為自己還有無盡的時間一樣，對著礦物薄片發呆一整天——"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那些“再也不能”，會比她曾以為的更快地到來。會比其他人、其他仍在探險的人、其他的……那些沒有生病的穆麗兒，更快地到來。"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她甚至一度以為，自己不屬於這片大地了。"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可是我好不甘心啊……真的好不甘心……", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#3$1"}, {"id": 313, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_wilderness_n", "screenadapt": "showall"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "amount": 0.0, "keep": "true"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "空氣裡只有木柴輕輕炸開的響聲。"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒的眼神落在火光跳躍的石縫上，過了好久，像是這不過只是另一次尋常的探險一樣，她突然輕輕開口。"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "BM，你餓不餓啊？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 325, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "蛤？你……話題也轉太快了吧。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 327, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿嘿……因為講了很多話，我餓了嘛。要不要吃宵夜？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 329, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們還有宵夜可以吃？", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……等等，別告訴我，你說的是那個——", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 333, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒慢悠悠地從背包最底層翻出來一個壓扁的飯盒，舉到BM面前晃了晃。"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不然呢？", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 338, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你竟然還特地留著！", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 340, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "本來是想留到最後慶祝我們找到礦石，但我想，現在慶祝也不錯。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "畢竟我憑藉強大的探險能力……找到了偷偷溜走的BM嘛。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1"}, {"id": 344, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 346, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這也……太狼狽了吧……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 348, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "探險嘛，狼狽才有紀念價值。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1"}, {"id": 350, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "BM無奈地點頭，打開了那個飯盒——已經看不出當時“精心製作”的形態，由多種食材混合而成的乾糧現在碎成一塊一塊的。"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……確實很像昨天早上我們看到的那片岩層剖面。", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 355, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至少，顏色上很相似……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 357, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對吧——", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 359, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且我一直覺得，如果一場探險的開頭就那麼狼狽，那結尾總該好一點的。", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 361, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（嚼嚼）", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1"}, {"id": 363, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……竟然還蠻好吃的，BM你快嚐嚐！", "name": "穆麗兒"}, "figure_art": "avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1"}, {"id": 365, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 367, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_032", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真是的……當然是因為好吃才給你的啊！", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_032"}, {"id": 369, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "兩人相互看了看，終於憋不住大笑了起來。"}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "月光融進搖曳的火光，夜色也一點一絲地在兩人的笑聲中逐漸隱去。"}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_wilderness_n", "screenadapt": "showall"}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$saferoom_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "晨風自崖頂瀉下，將白霧撕成一縷縷淡影。BM提早醒來，悄悄起身，沒有吵醒身邊還蜷縮著的穆麗兒。"}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她沿著昨日標記的路徑向上爬行，手指觸到岩壁冰冷粗糙的紋路，鞋底在石粒間發出鈍響。"}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她不知道自己在找些什麼。"}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是一個直覺，在她們昨天記錄樣本的時候，那一塊褐灰色岩層裡，有一絲奇異的反光。"}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "天光破曉。"}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_wilderness_m", "screenadapt": "showall", "fadetime": 4.0}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_snowfootstep", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "BM重新來到那個位置。"}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "站在朝陽初升的懸崖前，她低頭撥開石縫中的植物，刮去了岩石上的浮土。金色的晨光正好越過山口，斜照進這片裸露的岩面。"}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就在那一瞬，灰白的石層上有細小的閃斑綻開，像某種極其細密的星辰在岩層裡生長。"}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……這是……？", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這就是穆麗兒說的可能存在的稀有礦石嗎？哈哈，原來並不是稀有礦，而是之前就見過的磷灰石……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒其實早就醒來，提著工具包悄悄跟在BM後面爬上山。她站在遠處，望著BM的背影，眼神中帶著期待與一絲疼惜。"}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "BM沒有發現穆麗兒在自己的身後，她的視線跟著晨光在石紋中來回遊走，像在尋找什麼比礦石結構更精密的東西。"}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "為什麼在陽光下會……", "name": "“Basalt_Moon”"}}, {"id": 402, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 404, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "BM沉默了片刻，跪下，伸出手指輕輕觸摸那一塊磷灰石。"}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陽光越過她的肩膀灑下來，那層結晶在晨光的映照下緩慢地染上了新的顏色，藍綠光斑躍動，像是在對她的靠近作出溫柔回應。"}}, {"id": 406, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "BM愣了一下。"}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "下一秒，她的肩膀顫了一下。"}}, {"id": 408, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "然後是手肘、脊背。眼淚幾乎沒有任何預兆地砸下來，砸在岩面上，砸在自己的手背上。"}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "穆麗兒站定不動，感受著前方的BM無聲又彷彿能夠刺破鼓膜的慟哭。身後風穿過山谷，一隻羽獸低聲掠過懸崖，天光灑滿整個山面。"}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 412, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 4.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 413, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 414, "prop": "Character", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 415, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 416, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}